  "notes": "{育|はぐく}む implies careful, sustained nurturing over a long period. It is warmer and more deliberate than {育|そだ}てる.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n- Pattern: 〜を{育|はぐく}む\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {育|はぐく}んでいる: is nurturing, has been cultivating\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {愛情|あいじょう}を{育|はぐく}む (to nurture love)\n- {才能|さいのう}を{育|はぐく}む (to cultivate talent)\n- {信頼|しんらい}を{育|はぐく}む (to build trust)\n- {命|いのち}を{育|はぐく}む (to nurture life)\n- {友情|ゆうじょう}を{育|はぐく}む (to foster friendship)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {育|そだ}てる: to raise, to bring up (more general, practical)\n- {育|はぐく}む: to nurture, to foster (more emotional, literary)",
